<pre id="pre_1">




HIGH COURT OF JUDICATURE AT ALLAHABAD
 
 

?Court No. - 39
 

 
Case :- WRIT - C No. - 10390 of 2021
 

 
Petitioner :- Prem Singh
 
Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 2 Others
 
Counsel for Petitioner :- Lavkush Kumar Bhatt
 
Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C.,Baleshwar Chaturvedi
 

 
Hon&#x27;ble Mrs. Sunita Agarwal,J.
 
</pre><p data-structure="Precedent" id="p_1">Hon&#x27;ble Mrs. Sadhna Rani (Thakur),J.
</p> 
<p data-structure="CDiscource" id="p_2">The dispute in the present petition is with regard to the assessment of the electricity bill. 
</p> 
<p data-structure="Section" id="p_3">It is open for the petitioner to approach the respondent no.3 namely the Executive Engineer (Rural), Dakshinanchal Vidyut Vitran Nigam Ltd, Fatehgarh, District- Farrukhabad by invoking provisions of Clause 6.5 of the U.P. Electricity Supply Code, 2005. 
</p> 
<p data-structure="Conclusion" id="p_4">In view of the above, the wit petition is disposed of.
</p> 
<p data-structure="Conclusion" id="p_5">Order Date :- 26.3.2021
 
P Kesari
 



 




 

 
 
    
      
  
